-- Read-only dry run for the D-03 delete session.
--
-- Nothing here mutates the project: no DELETE, no SAVEWORK. Its only job is to
-- prove that Startup.dll really does run AVEVA_DESIGN_ENTRYMACRO in a detached
-- session, before that same channel is used to drive an irreversible DELETE.
--
-- Success is the appearance of this log with the VTWA still reported as live:
--   D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/projams_d03_probe.log

ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/projams_d03_probe.log" OVER
$P CODEX-D03-PROBE-ALIVE
=24381/107146
Q CE
Q TYPE
Q OWNE
Q SPRE
$P CODEX-D03-PROBE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
QUIT
